ly compatible with PyTorch's implementation. Specifically, it uses unbiased variance to update the moving average, and use sqrt(max(var, eps)) instead of sqrt(var + eps).","It is efficient, only 20% to 30% slower than UnsyncBN.","For the task of semantic segmentation, it is good to keep aspect ratio of images during training. So we re-implement the DataParallel module, and make it support distributing data to multiple GPUs in python dict, so…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/CSAILVision/semantic-segmentation-pytorch/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"ba45c2cd842132902e1d1936e00d847540a9bb7dc6d59f8c21fad6a23c6bf220","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:26:56.051Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:54.640Z","overviewRepoUpdated":"2024-01-15T14:26:43Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-15T17:00:54.542Z","enrichmentAttemptAt":"2026-10-05T17:50:45.959Z","latestRelease":null,"releaseCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T17:50:45.959Z","screenshots":[{"src":"previews/766e5db539a8d7bb3437e5c0.jpg","kind":"demo","capturedAt":"2026-10-18T15:56:45.216Z","url":"https://colab.research.google.com/github/CSAILVision/semantic-segmentation-pytorch/blob/master/notebooks/DemoSegmenter.ipynb"}],"demoHealth":{"url":"https://colab.research.google.com/github/CSAILVision/semantic-segmentation-pytorch/blob/master/notebooks/DemoSegmenter.ipynb","attemptedAt":"2026-10-18T15:56:45.215Z","status":"working","checkedAt":"2026-10-18T15:56:45.215Z","lastWorkingAt":"2026-10-18T15:56:45.215Z","target":"https://colab.research.google.com/github/CSAILVision/semantic-segmentation-pytorch/blob/master/notebooks/DemoSegmenter.ipynb","failureCount":0,"nextCheckAt":"2026-10-25T15:56:45.215Z","probeVersion":3,"consecutiveTemporaryFailures":0},"projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"This is a PyTorch implementation of semantic segmentation models on MIT ADE20K scene parsing dataset (","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/CSAILVision/semantic-segmentation-pytorch/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fin